t":"ただ感情の起伏がほとんど判別できず、リアクションも薄いので分かりづらい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"家事が得意で、祖母譲りの料理の腕は妹たちを感心させる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"運転免許を持ち、愛車は祖父から譲ってもらった古い国産車。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"独特の倫理観を持っており、時折インパクトのある発言をして周囲を驚かせる。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"58157"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"183 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"14307","sourceWorkId":"24431","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"体重（本版本）","value":"74 kg","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"14307","sourceWorkId":"24431","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_c57071","characterName":"宇藤 千鶴","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"58155","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"207545"}],"egsCharacterIds":["14305"],"vndbCharacterId":"c57071"},"originalCharacterName":"宇藤 千鶴","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"12月3日（射手座）"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"o"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"147"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"weight":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"38"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Shuuichi's younger sister who attends a private all-girls school, she is a honor student who is loved by all the teachers."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"When she was young she used to be sickly. Though she is fine now, even till this day she fondly remembers all the time she spent with her brother back then."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"To further her forbidden relationship with her brother Chizuru sometimes approaches him without restraint. Other times she is a little embarrassed to do it alone, so she cooperates with her cousin Suwana."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c57071"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"愛するお兄ちゃんのためならなんだってできちゃう直球妹"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"長い黒髪に大きな瞳が印象的な、鷲一の妹。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"私立の女子校に通い、教師たちからも可愛がられている優等生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"以前は少し身体が弱かったが、今ではもうすっかり健康で元気な様子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"８年よりさらに前、まだ宇藤一家が一緒に暮らしていたときのことをしっかり覚えており、仲が良かった兄妹関係をさらにエスカレートさせようと、とにかく兄ラブで猛アタックをかける前のめりな妹。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"一人で兄にアタックするのはちょっと恥ずかしいらしく、ほとんどスワナと一緒に行動することを好む。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"14305","sourceWorkId":"24431","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"愛するお兄さまのためならなんだってできちゃう直球妹"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"長い黒髪に大きな瞳が印象的な、鷲一の妹。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"私立の女子校に通い、教師たちからも可愛がられている優等生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"以前は少し身体が弱かったが、今ではすっかり健康で元気な様子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"幼い頃に兄と一緒に仲良く暮らしていた時のことをしっかり覚えており、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"良好な兄妹関係をエスカレートさせようと前のめりに猛アタックをかける。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ただ一人でアタックするのはちょっと恥ずかしいらしく、スワナと一緒に行動することが多い。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"58155"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{"birthday":[{"comparisonValue":"1203","source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"14305","value":"12/3"},{"comparisonValue":"0123","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"58155","value":"12月3日（射手座）"}]},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fe/fedc88810e492aca875b575a7ed431d605707ff694f8d75526b3a0e4055d0f14.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/68/68a61297db8215195b1d555aaceaead93f9ceea297565741da8a64e93d2b8783.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"八幡七味","creatorId":"vndb:s1988","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1988","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1988","name":"八幡 七味","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:207545:58155:21494:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c57072","characterName":"宇藤 スワナ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characte